      "angle": "Modern technology vs outdated methods",
      "folderId": "root",
      "originalPrompt": "REPLICATE THE REFERENCE IMAGE EXACTLY. Only two types of changes are permitted: (1) replace 'Green Flow' with 'Bugo' and (2) adapt the dishwasher cleaning concept to pest control while maintaining identical visual layout, colors, and composition.\n\nBACKGROUND: Light blue gradient background (#E8F4FD) with subtle water splash effects on the left side. Clean, bright atmosphere with soft lighting.\n\nHEADLINE (top-center): Dark blue text (#1565C0), bold sans-serif font: '3 סיבות לבחור ב-Bugo'\n\nLEFT COMPARISON BOX (light blue/white rounded rectangle):\nHEADER: Light blue text (#4A9FD9), medium weight: 'הפתרון החכם'\nBULLET POINTS (each with icon on right, text on left, RTL):\n- Shield icon + checkmark: 'בטוח למשפחה ולחיות מחמד'\n- Sparkle/star icon: 'תוצאות יעילות תוך ימים'\n- Leaf/eco icon: 'ללא כימיקלים ורעלים'\n\nRIGHT COMPARISON BOX (light gray/white rounded rectangle):\nHEADER: Red/pink text (#E57373), medium weight: 'השיטות הישנות'\nBULLET POINTS (each with X icon in red circle):\n- X icon: 'מכיל חומרים רעילים'\n- X icon: 'פתרון זמני ויקר'\n- Bottle icon (red outline): 'טיפולים חוזרים מזהמים'\n\nPRODUCT REPLACEMENT (bottom section):\nREMOVE the Green Flow dishwasher tablet box completely. In its exact position (bottom-left), place the Bugo ultrasonic pest repeller device: white oval/egg-shaped device with blue LED glow from bottom rim (#2196F3), 'Bugo' text in gray on device face, same 3D perspective and lighting as original product box.\n\nREMOVE the detergent bottle and scattered tablets on the right. Replace with traditional pest control items: spray bottle with skull/crossbones warning symbol, mouse traps, and chemical pest control containers - all in muted gray tones to contrast with the clean Bugo device.\n\nICONS: Maintain all icon styles and positions - shield with checkmark (green), sparkle/star (blue), leaf (green) on left side. Red X circles and warning bottle icon on right side.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY: All text right-aligned (RTL). Maintain exact font weights, sizes, and hierarchical relationships as reference.\n\nCOLOR SCHEME: Preserve exact colors - light blue background (#E8F4FD), dark blue headlines (#1565C0), light blue accents (#4A9FD9), green icons (#7CB342), red warning elements (#E57373), white boxes with subtle shadows.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nDO NOT add any element not present in the reference. DO NOT remove the comparison box structure. DO NOT reposition any text or graphic elements. Only replace the product category context while maintaining identical visual composition.",
