      "originalPrompt": "REPLICATE the reference image's LAYOUT, COMPOSITION, TYPOGRAPHY STYLE, COLOR SCHEME, and DESIGN APPROACH. ADAPT the visual context to pest control: replace the eco-cleaning products with the Bugo device, replace plastic waste with pest-related imagery, and replace all text with Hebrew pest control messaging, right-aligned (RTL).\n\nBACKGROUND: Split-screen composition with vertical black divider line (#000000, 3px width) down the center. Light blue sky gradient background (#87CEEB to #B0E0E6) on both sides. Wooden plank surface (#D2B48C with natural wood grain texture) at bottom third of both sides.\n\nLEFT SIDE - PEST PROBLEM:\nHEADLINE (top-left): \"מזיקים\" - bold black sans-serif text (#000000), large size, positioned in upper left corner.\nVISUAL CONTENT: Instead of plastic bottles, show pest-infested area - scattered cockroach silhouettes, ant trails, spider webs, mouse droppings on the wooden surface. Dark, dirty, chaotic feel with pest shadows and signs of infestation.\n\nRIGHT SIDE - BUGO SOLUTION:\nBRAND (top-right): \"Bugo\" - elegant black serif font (#000000), same size and positioning as \"Green FLOW\" in reference, with small blue accent dot after the 'o' (#4682B4).\n\nFEATURE TEXT 1 (mid-right): \"הגנה אולטרסונית\" - medium black text (#000000), clean sans-serif, positioned where \"בקבוק זכוכית רב פעמי\" appears in reference.\n\nFEATURE TEXT 2 (lower-right): \"ללא כימיקלים\" - medium black text (#000000), clean sans-serif, with curved arrow pointing to Bugo device.\n\nPRODUCT REPLACEMENT: REMOVE the Green Flow pump bottle and soap sheets box COMPLETELY. In their exact position on the wooden surface, place the Bugo device: white oval/egg-shaped ultrasonic pest repeller with blue LED glow from bottom rim (#2196F3), 'Bugo' text visible on device face in gray. Device should be angled slightly to show dimensionality, same perspective as the original pump bottle.\n\nCTA BUTTON (bottom-center, spanning the divider): White rectangular banner with black border (#000000), containing pointing finger emoji and Hebrew text \"להזמנה מיידית\" in bold black font.\n\nVISUAL ADAPTATIONS:\n- Remove all cleaning product elements (soap, bottles, eco-friendly imagery)\n- Left side: Add pest silhouettes and infestation signs instead of plastic waste\n- Right side: Show clean, protected home environment around Bugo device\n- Maintain the contrast concept: messy/pest-problem vs clean/pest-free\n- Keep wooden surface texture and light blue background identical\n- Preserve all typography hierarchy and positioning\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nKeep the same layout and element positions. You MUST replace cleaning product visuals with pest-control relevant imagery. The core message structure of 'problem vs solution' remains identical, just adapted from environmental waste to pest control.",
