tes (cockroach, ant, mouse) with prohibition signs, or exterminator equipment to represent the 'old way' problems.\n\nICONS: Use shield icons for benefits on left, X icons for problems on right, same style and positioning as reference. Replace any cleaning-related icons with pest-control relevant ones (shield for protection, checkmark for effectiveness, house for coverage).\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nKeep the same layout and element positions. You MUST replace any visual elements specific to dishwasher/cleaning (detergent products, tablets, bottles, cleaning imagery) with pest-control or clean-home relevant visuals. DO NOT keep cleaning-irrelevant imagery.",
