      "originalPrompt": "REPLICATE the reference layout, composition, typography style, and color scheme. ADAPT all visual content to pest control — no traces of dishwasher/cleaning niche.\n\nBACKGROUND: Light blue-gray gradient (#E8F4FD center fading to #B8D4F0 at edges). Clean, neutral background — NO water splashes, NO bubbles, NO cleaning foam. Subtle cloud-like texture in very light blue tones.\n\nHEADLINE (top-center): \"3 סיבות לבחור ב-Bugo\" — bold dark blue sans-serif (#1A3A5C), large size, centered alignment.\n\nLEFT COLUMN — \"הפתרון החדש\" CARD:\n- Light blue rounded rectangle card (#F0F8FF), subtle shadow, rounded corners (12px radius)\n- Header: \"הפתרון החדש\" — medium blue text (#4A90E2), bold, right-aligned\n- Three benefit rows, each with:\n  - Green checkmark icon (#4CAF50) on right side\n  - Hebrew benefit text on left, right-aligned (RTL):\n    Row 1: \"בטוח למשפחה ולחיות מחמד\" — dark gray (#333333)\n    Row 2: \"טכנולוגיה דו-גלית מתקדמת\" — dark gray (#333333)\n    Row 3: \"הגנה רציפה עד 5 שנים\" — dark gray (#333333)\n\nRIGHT COLUMN — \"השיטות הישנות\" CARD:\n- Light gray rounded rectangle card (#F5F5F5), same shadow and corner radius\n- Header: \"השיטות הישנות\" — medium red text (#D32F2F), bold, right-aligned\n- Three drawback rows, each with:\n  - Red X icon (#E53935) on right side\n  - Hebrew drawback text on left, right-aligned (RTL):\n    Row 1: \"כימיקלים מזיקים ורעילים\" — dark gray (#333333)\n    Row 2: \"טיפולים יקרים וחוזרים\" — dark gray (#333333)\n    Row 3: \"פתרונות זמניים ולא יעילים\" — dark gray (#333333)\n\nPRODUCT IMAGES (bottom):\nLEFT: The Bugo device — white oval/egg-shaped ultrasonic pest repeller with blue LED glow effect (#2196F3) around the bottom rim, \"Bugo\" text in gray on the device face. Clean presentation against light background.\nRIGHT: Traditional pest control items — spray bottle, mouse traps, and chemical containers arranged messily to contrast with clean Bugo presentation.\n\nICONS (scattered around products): Small pest silhouettes (cockroach, ant, mouse, spider) with red prohibition circles and diagonal slashes to show elimination.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY: All Hebrew text right-aligned (RTL), sans-serif font family matching reference style hierarchy.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nKeep the exact same layout structure and element positions. All visuals must be pest-control relevant — completely remove any cleaning/dishwashing imagery. The comparison concept translates perfectly: modern Bugo technology vs outdated pest control methods.",
