      "folderId": "folder-1776006536682-mfym",
      "originalPrompt": "REPLICATE the reference image's LAYOUT, COMPOSITION, TYPOGRAPHY STYLE, COLOR SCHEME, and DESIGN APPROACH. ADAPT the visual context to pest control: replace ALL supplement-specific visual elements with pest-control relevant visuals. Replace the brand name with 'Bugo' and all text with English, left-aligned (LTR).\n\nBACKGROUND: Clean white background (#FFFFFF), no texture, no pattern.\n\nHEADLINE (top-center):\nLine 1: \"DUAL-WAVE\" - large bold sans-serif font in bright pink (#FF69B4), centered, approximately 80px font size\nLine 2: \"ULTRASONIC + ELECTROMAGNETIC\" - bold sans-serif in deep purple (#663399), centered, approximately 24px font size\nLine 3: \"(WITHOUT CHEMICALS OR TOXINS)\" - white text inside bright pink rounded rectangle pill shape (#FF69B4), centered below headline, approximately 18px font size\n\nPRODUCT (center): REMOVE the supplement pouch COMPLETELY. In its exact position, place the Bugo device: a white oval/egg-shaped ultrasonic pest repeller with blue LED glow from the bottom rim (#2196F3), 'Bugo' text in gray on the device face. The user will upload the actual Bugo product photo as a second reference image — use that exact product image.\n\nPEST CARDS (left column, 3 cards):\nCard 1 (top-left): White rounded rectangle card with pink border (#FF69B4). Small cockroach icon in top-left corner. \"Cockroaches\" in pink bold text (#FF69B4). Below: \"Dual-wave technology disrupts hiding spots\" in black text.\nCard 2 (middle-left): White rounded rectangle card with pink border. Small ant icon. \"Ants\" in pink bold text. Below: \"Electromagnetic waves penetrate ant trails\" in black text.\nCard 3 (bottom-left): White rounded rectangle card with pink border. Small mouse icon. \"Mice & Rats\" in pink bold text. Below: \"Ultrasonic frequencies create uncomfortable environment\" in black text.\n\nPEST CARDS (right column, 3 cards):\nCard 4 (top-right): White rounded rectangle card with pink border. Small spider icon. \"Spiders\" in pink bold text. Below: \"Multi-frequency waves target web-building\" in black text.\nCard 5 (middle-right): White rounded rectangle card with pink border. Small bed bug icon. \"Bed Bugs\" in pink bold text. Below: \"Penetrates mattresses and furniture\" in black text.\nCard 6 (bottom-right): White rounded rectangle card with pink border. Small flea icon. \"Fleas\" in pink bold text. Below: \"Disrupts breeding and feeding cycles\" in black text.\n\nRATING (bottom-center): Five pink star icons (#FF69B4) in a row, all filled.\n\nGUARANTEE TEXT (bottom): \"30 Day Money-Back Guarantee + Free Shipping\" - deep purple text (#663399), bold sans-serif, centered, approximately 20px font size. The pink \"+\" should match the pink color scheme (#FF69B4).\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nKeep the same layout and element positions. You MUST replace any visual elements specific to the supplement niche (pills, capsules, herbs, supplement imagery) with pest-control relevant visuals. DO NOT keep supplement-irrelevant imagery. All cards should have the same rounded rectangle style, pink borders, and layout as the original ingredient cards.",
