Hand should appear natural and authentic, not overly polished.\n\nLIGHTING: Soft, natural indoor lighting with warm undertones. No harsh shadows, consistent with home environment rather than fluorescent store lighting.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 9:16 (vertical mobile format)\n\nKeep the same authentic, user-generated content feel. The hand position, bubble placement, and overall composition should match the reference exactly, just adapted to pest control context. Do NOT add floating icons, pest silhouettes, or decorative elements not present in the original reference.",
