 three containers were positioned.\n\nBRAND LOGO (bottom-center):\n\"Bugo\" — Clean, modern sans-serif font in white, positioned at bottom with proper spacing from product area. Simple text logo, no graphic elements or icons.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 9:16\n\nKeep the same typography hierarchy and spacing relationships. The empathetic, apologetic tone should remain consistent. DO NOT add floating icons, pest silhouettes, or decorative elements that were not in the original reference. Keep the background clean and the focus on the typography and single product image.",
