c snake visible in bottom-right corner of frame on grass, same species, same position, same lighting as reference.\n\nCTA BUTTON (bottom-right area): Red rounded rectangle button (#DC143C), white bold text 'קבלו את שלכם היום' — white bold sans-serif, centered in button.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nDO NOT add any element not present in the reference. DO NOT remove any element. DO NOT reposition any element. The snake, child position, device grip, grass texture, lighting, and all visual elements must be pixel-identical to the reference.",
