      "angle": "Technology superiority and innovation",
      "folderId": "root",
      "originalPrompt": "REPLICATE THE REFERENCE IMAGE EXACTLY. Only two types of changes are permitted: (1) replace the brand name 'BugMD' with 'Bugo' and (2) keep all English text as English, left-aligned (LTR). Every visual element — colors, layout, typography, spacing, spray bottle silhouette — must be pixel-identical to the reference.\n\nBACKGROUND: Solid dark forest green (#3A5F3A) background, no gradient, no texture, completely flat.\n\nHEADLINE (top section): White text, serif font, medium weight, left-aligned: 'You're not buying pest spray. You're choosing what your family breathes.'\n\nBODY PARAGRAPH 1 (second section): White text, sans-serif font, smaller than headline, left-aligned, justified text block: 'Under every kitchen sink in America, there's a can with a warning label. It says things like hazardous to humans and domestic animals' and call Poison Control if ingested.' These chemicals -- pyrethroids, organophosphates, neonicotinoids --were designed to kill. They do. They also linger on the surfaces where your children eat, crawl, and play.'\n\nTRANSITION LINE (middle section): White text, sans-serif font, same size as body text, left-aligned: 'There's another option.'\n\nPRODUCT DESCRIPTION (fourth section): White text, sans-serif font, same size as body text, left-aligned: 'Bugo. Advanced dual-wave technology: ultrasonic + electromagnetic frequencies. Repels cockroaches, mice, ants, spiders, bed bugs, mosquitoes, and more without contact.'\n\nSOCIAL PROOF (fifth section): White text, sans-serif font, same size as body text, left-aligned: 'Laboratory tested. Pet-friendly. Kid-friendly. 50,000+ homes protected. 4.8/5 star rating.'\n\nTAGLINE (bottom left): White text, italic serif font, slightly smaller than body text, left-aligned: 'What's plugged into your wall says something about you'\n\nSPRAY BOTTLE SILHOUETTE (bottom right): Replace the spray bottle silhouette with a Bugo device silhouette - white oval/egg-shaped ultrasonic pest repeller silhouette, same size and position as the original spray bottle, same opacity/transparency effect.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nDO NOT add any element not present in the reference. DO NOT remove any element. DO NOT reposition any element. Keep exact same typography hierarchy, spacing, and visual weight of all text elements.",
