            "adaptedText": "You're not buying pest control. You're eliminate bed bugs forever"
          },
          {
            "label": "body-paragraph-1",
            "adaptedText": "While Americans still use 1950s poison technology, Israel developed breakthrough dual-wave systems. Most 'ultrasonic' devices use single frequencies that pests adapt to within days. That's why they fail after a few weeks of seeming success."
