      "originalPrompt": "REPLICATE the reference layout, composition, typography style, and color scheme. ADAPT all visual content to pest control — no traces of laundry/cleaning niche.\n\nBACKGROUND: Light gray textured wall background (#F5F5F5) with subtle texture, same lighting and depth as reference.\n\nFRAMED POSTER (left side): White rectangular frame with thin silver/gray border, mounted on wall with small clips at top. White background inside frame (#FFFFFF).\n\nHEADLINE (inside frame, top):\nLine 1: \"למה משפחות\" — bright blue handwritten-style font (#5DADE2), casual brush lettering, same size and style as reference\nLine 2: \"צריכות\" — continuation of blue text, same style\nLine 3: \"BUGO\" — lime green handwritten-style font (#7CB342), bold and prominent, replacing 'LAUNDRY SHEETS'\n\nColorful underline strokes beneath 'BUGO' — lime green and coral pink brush strokes, same style as reference.\n\nBULLET POINTS (inside frame, lower section):\n- Dark gray handwritten font (#696969), casual style\nBullet 1: \"- הגנה עוצמתיכה\"\nBullet 2: \"- נגד מגוון מזיקים\"\nBullet 3: \"- בלי כימיקלים מזיקים\"\n\nPRODUCT (right side): REMOVE the Earth Breeze laundry package completely. In its exact position, place the Bugo device: white oval/egg-shaped ultrasonic pest repeller with blue LED glow from bottom rim (#2196F3), 'Bugo' text in gray on device face. The user will upload the actual Bugo product photo — use that exact product image. Position it at the same angle and lighting as the original package.\n\nLIGHTING: Soft, even lighting from left side, creating gentle shadows on the right side of both frame and product, matching the reference lighting.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 4:3 landscape\n\nKeep the same layout, frame style, and educational poster concept. Replace ALL laundry-specific content with pest control messaging. The frame should look like an educational poster about pest control benefits, not laundry. Do NOT add floating pest icons, shields, or decorative elements not present in the original reference.",
