ce logo.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 1:1\n\nKeep the exact same layout structure and typography hierarchy. The background must be completely clean home environment — no raspberries, no fruit, no food elements. All text must be right-aligned Hebrew (RTL). The Bugo device replaces the bottle in the exact same position and perspective.",
